1
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:43,500
Grounded for Christmas is a romance, tv movie film directed by Amyn Kaderali.

2
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
When a winter storm hits Cleveland and grounds flights, the nearby
hotels quickly fill up with stranded travelers.

3
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:58,500
Nina, a pilot, reluctantly agrees to let her arrogant but charming
fellow pilot, Brady, stay at her nearby parents' home.

4
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
But when they discover her family is hosting a tree trimming party that night and that
her ex will be there, Brady pretends to be her boyfriend to help her out.

5
00:28:07,500 --> 00:28:13,500
Nina, played by Julianna Guill.

6
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:51,000
Brady, played by Corey Sevier.

7
00:39:22,500 --> 00:39:28,500
Susan, played by Cheryl Ladd.

8
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Bert, played by Ted Atherton.

9
00:50:37,500 --> 00:50:43,500
Marcy, played by Paula Brancati.

10
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
Will, played by Jacob Blair.

11
01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
A Very Jonas Christmas Movie is a 2025 American Christmas musical comedy film
directed by Jessica Yu and written by Isaac Aptaker and Elizabeth Berger.

12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
It stars the Jonas Brothers (Kevin Jonas, Joe Jonas,
and Nick Jonas) and Chloe Bennet.

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
The film was released on Disney+ and Hulu on November 14, 2025.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
It received positive reviews from critics, with particular praise
directed at the music and the chemistry of the Jonas Brothers.

15
01:24:22,500 --> 01:24:28,500
The tone is emotional.
